{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24894","headline":"席上赠刘梦得 · 牛僧孺","name":"席上赠刘梦得","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"粉署爲郎四十春，今来名辈更无人。\n休论世上昇沉事，且鬬樽前见在身。\n珠玉会应成咳唾，山川犹觉露精神。\n莫嫌恃酒轻言语，曾把文章谒後尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牛僧孺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24894.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24894","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}